<title>USA: Taco Cabana to buy back up to 1.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Taco Cabana to buy back up to 1.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taco Cabana Inc said its board has authorized a program to repurchase up to 1.5 million shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>It said that the timing, price, quantity and manner of purchases will be made at the discretion of management and will depend upon market conditions.</p>
<p>Taco Cabana will fund the repurchase program through available bank credit facilities as well as currently held short-term investments. The company said that the repurchase program would have no effect upon its future expansion plans.</p>
</text>
